Wed Nov 4 17:58:00 UTC 2026 - David Anes <david.anes@suse.com>

- Update to 0.1.4
  * Memory safety fixes (0.1.3 and 0.1.4)
- Remove icu-build-fix.patch, the fix is in upstream commit af3197f
- Mark COPYING as %license in the tools subpackage, remove the COPYING
  copy from the devel doc dir
- Add libfreehand-0.1.4-doxygen-cfg.patch: remove 14 obsolete tags, fix
  the PAPER_TYPE value, and add the inc directory to INPUT in
  docs/doxygen/doxygen.cfg for doxygen 1.18
- List the fh2raw, fh2svg, and fh2text binaries explicitly in the tools
  subpackage instead of a bindir glob
- Require pkgconfig(icu-uc) instead of pkgconfig(icu-i18n), matching the
  icu-uc module checked by configure
- Drop the redundant --disable-werror configure flag, the upstream default
  is no since 0.1.4

